5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the people behind the science. Who is actually here to run the experiments?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am curious about the true value of the grant. I want to know which costs the agency still covers centrally.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I am worried about the shared equipment. If the machines are already overloaded, the new project will just add to the chaos.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am concerned about where the actual science gets interrupted. I want to know what delays the panel usually hears about only after the money is committed.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the gap between projected timelines and actual delivery. I want to see what finished awards really achieved.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, if the agency covers central costs, does that free up local funds for the people who actually do the work?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
